; nxt-board-bootstrap.g
;
; Board pack loading moved to nxt-board-pack-loader.g (invoked from nxt.g after
; nxt-user-vars.g). Opt-in file remains 0:/sys/nxt-board-bootstrap.requested; opt-out
; nxt-board-bootstrap.skip; override nxt-user-board.g — all handled by the pack loader.
;
; This file is kept as a documentation anchor. M98 P"nxt-board-bootstrap.g" alone does nothing.

M99
